            "review_text": "Li Li K\n39 contributions\n0\nFantastic Viet street food\nDec 2017 • Family\nWe were at Co Ba for dinner and ordered banh xeo (big crispy light tumeric pancake with minced pork, bean sprout and prawn filling), banh khot \n(Small round fried flat rice cakes topped w a shrimp each), steamed rice cakes in mini bowls topped w minced meat and eaten w fish sauce and chili. We also had a delicious lotus stem salad and fried spring rolls. All the dishes were served w very fresh complimentary green salad and herbs. The food was good and I especially enjoy the banh khot. For drinks we had mang cau (custard apple smoothie) and some coconut juice.\nRead more\nWritten December 29, 2017",
