            "review_text": "King-n-Queen7\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nNice Rice Pancakes\nSep 2017 • Couples\nWe live very close to this place so we usually visit for a quick Vietnamese food fix. The Pork Rice Pancakes are the things to go for here. The other dishes are good but that's how far i'll go with that. The waiters are friendly with us and the service is good. Beer is cheap and served cold. Outdoor seating area is pleasant. Prices aren't too bad for what you get. I hope this place keeps it up and continues to do well.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 13, 2017",
