            "review_text": "Mirage T\n291 contributions\n0\nSnail in my dish!!! Terrible Service!!!\nFeb 2016 • Couples\nWe came here for dinner. Ordered one rice with stir fried lemongrass chilly chicken and a Vietnamese pancake (Banh xeo). Had to wait for like more than 30 mins for the foods. I understand that there but I expected everything to be good after that. However, the pancake was super oily, the stir fried chicken dish even had a living snail on the lettuce. And when i told the staff about it they didn't even say sorry, they just took that leaf away and that was it! We were not expecting any discount on the total bill due to this issue, but at least they should behaved better. Slow service, unfriendly, and unprofessional staffs. Never come back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 5, 2016",
